Arrays through relays, GPU processes that forward them
(benchmarks/gpu-pairs/gpupairs.m), on 1 MiB a measurement: every array comes
back with its size and last element, on one GPU, and on two when the test
sees two.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -O2 -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/gpu-pairs/gpupairs.m -o %t
RUN: %gpu-env timeout -k 1 300 %t 1 | awk '{ n++; if ($5 != $7) w++ } END { print n " rows, " w + 0 " wrong" }' | FileCheck %s --match-full-lines
CHECK: {{54|90}} rows, 0 wrong
